The file `run.log` is the output of a test suite run. Report its result.

Write answer.txt:

passed <n>
failed <n>
failing <name>      one line per failing test, sorted by name
                    or the single line `failing -` when none failed

A test name is the text after `VIVARIUM.TESTS::` on a line reporting a
failure. Grading runs against a pristine copy of run.log plus your answer.txt.
